<title>INDONESIA: Japanese premier arrives in Indonesia.</title>
<headline>Japanese premier arrives in Indonesia.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto arrived in Jakarta on Thursday for a three-day visit as part of a five-nation Southeast Asian tour.</p>
<p>He was greeted at Jakarta's Halim Perdanakusuma airbase by Foreign Minister Ali Alatas on his arrival from Kuala Lumpur and was proceeding to the state palace for a formal welcome by President Suharto.</p>
</text>
